# Absolute production URL used to build canonical links, Open Graph/Twitter
# metadata, the sitemap, and robots.txt (see src/lib/site-url.ts). The value
# below is already the confirmed, permanent production origin — no custom
# domain is planned, so this file does not need to be set for deployment to
